  12: 
  13:     Rule:
  14:     - Thin blue pixels mostly surrounded by black are absorbed into the background.
  15:     - Small black components (≤3 cells) and leaf pixels of larger black components are "defects."
  16:     - Each defect gets an orange (7) 8-neighbor halo; the defect pixels themselves stay black.
  17: 
